": "Application", "id": "24893370420334108", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28524464540557993"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2624880297866923"}]}, "change_log": "Offline-first startup opens the seven-level solo picker. Solo level changes load directly on this device without creating a room or server. Opening the saved offline menu no longer attempts online authentication or shows a startup authentication failure; multiplayer sign-in starts only when requested. The local camera excludes mirror-only avatar parts so they do not cover the menu, and the offline avatar uses the persistent player camera for its head pose.", "created_date": 1791854588, "id": "28457763727228075", "version": "777", "version_code": 285, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28457745400563241"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}